    "title": "Pyramids And Dependency (Part 1)",
    "summary": "PYRAMID: age (up) · sex (left/right) · EXPANSIVE (youthful): Niger · CONSTRICTIVE (ageing): Japan, SG",
    "startSec": 247.0,
    "endSec": 308.15,
