    "title": "Where Lagos Is And How It Grew",
    "summary": "LAGOS: south-west Nigeria, Gulf of Guinea · Lagoon = sheltered harbour → PORT · Capital until 1991 → ABUJA. Still the $ hub",
    "startSec": 40.15,
